From: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] input: forward tablets and preserve accelerated pointer motion

Use libinput acceleration for pointer navigation while retaining raw relative
motion for games. Handle absolute pointers and tablet-v2 pressure/tilt input,
with pointer fallback for clients without tablet support.

--- a/src/wlserver.cpp
+++ b/src/wlserver.cpp
@@ -46,6 +46,8 @@
 #include <wlr/types/wlr_pointer.h>
 #include <wlr/types/wlr_seat.h>
 #include <wlr/types/wlr_touch.h>
+#include <wlr/types/wlr_tablet_tool.h>
+#include <wlr/types/wlr_tablet_v2.h>
 #include <wlr/types/wlr_drm.h>
 #include <wlr/util/log.h>
 #include <wlr/xwayland/server.h>
